<html><head><title>How</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px;">There are </span><span style="margin: 0px;">various ways</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> for external parties to </span><span style="margin: 0px;">participate</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> in transdisciplinary education. Often, the initiative comes from an educational institution that develops a project and involves relevant external partners. Sometimes, a complex question from a company or organization will come to the attention of the educational institution. You might already have such a question in mind.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></body></html>